<https://onto.example.org/medical-ai-legal#Tension_BlackBox_PatentProtection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        Deep-learning medical AI is inherently opaque (black-box). Patent protection incentivises\r\n        secrecy over model weights. EU AI Act Art.13 and C-817/19 black-box prohibition\r\n        require transparency for high-risk AI systems, creating structural tension with\r\n        commercial IP protection strategies. TSD Art.2 reinforces the secrecy interest;\r\n        TSD Art.5 carve-outs are the only legislative bridge, but their scope is unresolved.\r\n    "@en .
