<https://onto.example.org/medical-ai-legal> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\r\n        Ontology capturing the legal landscape governing AI-driven automated\r\n        decision-making in medical contexts. Covers CJEU precedents on GDPR\r\n        Art.22, UPC/EPO patent litigation in MedTech, the EU AI Act high-risk\r\n        regime, MDR 2017/745, PLD 2024/2853, EHDS 2025/327, DGA 2022/868,\r\n        and Data Act 2023/2854 — with full precedent chains, SHACL runtime\r\n        constraints, and compliance obligation mappings.\r\n        Imports: W3C DPV v2.0 (data privacy vocabulary), AIRO (AI risk ontology),\r\n        ELI (European Legislation Identifier), ECLI (European Case Law Identifier).\r\n    "@en .
