<https://onto.example.org/medical-ai-legal#Risk_TradeSecretTransparencyConflict> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Medical AI operators relying on TSD Art.2 to protect model weights face: (a) mandatory AI Act Art.13 disclosure to deployers; (b) GDPR Art.15(1)(h) actionable explanation obligations to data subjects; (c) mandatory supervisory authority adjudication when TSD is claimed (C-203/22). Hybrid strategy required: patent final outputs, trade secret the AI platform, use ZKP/ZKML for auditor verification without weight disclosure."@en .
