<https://onto.example.org/medical-ai-legal#OmnibusGDPR_Art22_Proposal_20251119> <https://onto.example.org/medical-ai-legal#amendmentDescription> "Commission proposal (2025-11-19) to replace GDPR Art.22(1)-(2) prohibition structure with an exhaustive positive permission list for solely automated decision-making. EDPB-EDPS Joint Opinion 2/2026 (2026-02-11) strongly opposes the reframing, citing CJEU confirmation of Art.22 as a prohibition in principle (C-634/21, C-817/19). Status: UNADOPTED — in trilogue negotiation as of 2026-05-10. MAILO SHACL shapes remain grounded in current prohibition structure. If adopted, NodeShapes C634_Art22ProhibitionShape and related shapes require reformulation to encode positive permission conditions rather than absence of exception." .
